6. Conclusion
I successfully completed OverTheWire Bandit Level 0 to Level 1 by connecting to the remote server using SSH, locating the readme file, and reading its contents using the cat command. I used the retrieved password to log in to Bandit Level 1.

This challenge helped me understand basic Linux commands, SSH connections, and password-based authentication.
